    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d471">

                <pb facs="0605" n="520" sameAs="frus:frus1919v02/pg520"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">882.032/25: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Liberia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Bundy</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Monrovia</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-01-22T17:00:00-00:43"><hi rendition="#italic">January 22,
                                1919, 5 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received 10.20
                            p.m.</hi>]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Legislature of Liberia adjourned today and not on January 20th as reported
                    Legation’s January 11, 10 a.m.<anchor n="63" xml:id="d471-f1"/> President of
                    Liberia informs me that Legislature took no action on any applications for
                    concessions.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bundy</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
